{
  "reasoning": "The goal is to upgrade a basic schematic of a scale drawing into a polished, textbook-ready illustration. I must ensure the AI strictly locks in the mathematical features—specifically the 10:4 aspect ratio rectangle, the measurement lines, and the exact text labels ('10 cm', '4 cm', 'Scale: 1 cm = 90 m'). Then, I will instruct the AI to transform the basic geometric primitives inside the rectangle into a lush, stylized top-down park scene using a premium mobile game art style, replacing circles with detailed tree canopies and the simple curve with a cobblestone path, while maintaining a pure white background.",
  "image_prompt": "Transform the provided geometric sketch into a premium digital illustration of a top-down park map, heavily inspired by high-end casual mobile game art. STRICTLY PRESERVE the original composition, layout, exact rectangular dimensions, dashed extension lines, arrows, and all text labels exactly as written ('10 cm', '4 cm', 'Scale: 1 cm = 90 m'). Render the central rectangle as a lush, manicured park area strictly contained within its crisp, dark green border. Transform the flat green circles in the corners into beautifully textured, stylized top-down tree canopies with soft, volumetric layered leaves. Transform the curvy beige line into a neat, stylized cobblestone or gravel walking path winding through soft, vibrant green grass. Add subtle, elegant details like tiny colorful flower bushes or small wooden benches along the path to enhance the park theme, but ensure all park elements are strictly bounded by the rectangle. Use a vibrant, pastel-leaning color palette, smooth gradient shading, and crisp clean vector-style edges. The background outside the park, behind the dimension lines and labels, must remain pure crisp white.",
  "style_guidelines": "Do not alter the spelling, placement, or numbers in the text. Do not warp straight measurement lines or arrows. Do not change the 10:4 aspect ratio of the main rectangle. Do not add the numbers 900 or 360 anywhere. No photorealism. No cluttered backgrounds; keep the background outside the rectangle pure white."
}

